{
  "$comment": "How the projects of the roadmap are described when a plan starts: the custom fields, the teams and the people who work on the projects, and the formula of the contingency. Order matters: it is the order of the lists. Colors are the task colors, checked for contrast in every theme: a team has one, and each value of a list can have one, for its tag. A team has a phase (analysis, development, test), which places its work in the standard arrangement of a project, and may have a formula on the tags of the teams without one, which fills in its days in a new project. A person marked default is in the table of the days of every new project. A list of exclusive values marked 'group' lets the roadmap group the projects by it. Settings → Roadmap edits a copy of this in the plan; 'Carica i predefiniti' brings it back.",
